Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; screen2026 board: let https://paulux0808.github.io enter fullscreen WITHOUT a click
; in Google Chrome and Microsoft Edge, for every user of this PC (needs administrator).
; After applying, close every Chrome/Edge window once (or restart the PC).
; Check: open chrome://policy (or edge://policy) and look for AutomaticFullscreenAllowedForUrls.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Google\Chrome\AutomaticFullscreenAllowedForUrls]
"1"="https://paulux0808.github.io"

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\Edge\AutomaticFullscreenAllowedForUrls]
"1"="https://paulux0808.github.io"
